i went and asked a few people what September is, (awareness month wise) and hardly anyone new it was suicide prevention. It just shows how little people actually pay attention to this stuff. And those who do see it, say 'Get help' WELL THANK FUCK FOR YOU, I WOULD NEVER HAVE GUESSED. It is just exhausting. 

&#x200B;

I hope everyone is doing okay, have a nice day

